        "notice": "ALL chain state, calldata and events are public, including wallet relationships. Never submit names, diagnoses, plaintext records, URLs, encryption keys, or plaintext hashes. Permissions are policy signals for an authenticated off-chain key/storage gateway; they do not hide chain state or retract data or keys already disclosed.",
